#: ../../../components/surrogate.md:77
msgid ""
"See [TrainingSet](training_set.md)'s `FeasibilityClassificationSet` for "
"how training data is extracted for these classification surrogates. For "
"pairwise comparison, use the dedicated `ComparisonSurrogate`-family "
"implementations rather than these classification surrogates, paired with "
"[SurrogateManager](surrogate_manager.md)'s `PairwiseSurrogateManager` and"
" `PairwiseComparisonSet`."
msgstr ""
"これらの分類サロゲートの学習データ抽出方法は[TrainingSet](training_set.md)の`FeasibilityClassificationSet`を参照してください。"
